menuconfig MODULES_SERVO_TEST
	bool "servo_test"
	default n
	---help---
		Bench motor test driven by the EC11 rotary encoder and the ST7789
		display: the dial sets a target RPM, the shaft button enables/disables
		the output, and ESC telemetry is shown on screen. Drives motors via
		the actuator_test topic (works while disarmed).
